Feature: Security acceptance test with Nmap

  Background:
    Given "nmap" is installed
    And the following profile:
      | name     | value       |
      | hostname | 127.0.0.1   |

  Scenario: Verify Jenkins port is open
    When I launch an "nmap" attack with:
      """
      nmap -p 8080 <hostname>
      """
    Then the output should contain:
      """
      8080/tcp open
      """

  Scenario: Verify Prometheus port is open
    When I launch an "nmap" attack with:
      """
      nmap -p 9090 <hostname>
      """
    Then the output should contain:
      """
      9090/tcp open
      """
